    "maintainer_can_modify": false,
    "title": "interfaces: fix findAncestorByHash returning true for unknown block",
    "user": {
      "login": "Yudis-bit",
      "id": 85178972,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1MTc4OTcy",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85178972?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Yudis-bit",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Yudis-bit/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "Fixes #36472.\n\nWhen `findAncestorByHash(block_hash, ancestor_hash, ...)` is called with an unknown or null `block_hash`, `LookupBlockIndex(block_hash)` returns `nullptr`. The preceding check `if (block && ancestor && block->GetAncestor(...) != ancestor) ancestor = nullptr;` evaluates to false when `block` is null, leaving `ancestor` untouched. If `ancestor_hash` exists, `FillBlock(ancestor, ...)` evaluates to true, falsely reporting that an unknown descendant descends from a known block.\n\nThis patch updates the guard in `src/node/interfaces.cpp` to ensure `ancestor` is reset to null whenever `!block || !ancestor || block->GetAncestor(ancestor->nHeight) != ancestor`.\n\nUnit test coverage is added in `src/test/interfaces_tests.cpp` asserting that `findAncestorByHash` returns false when `block_hash` is null, preserves `height = -1` in the output struct, returns false when `ancestor_hash` is null, returns false when both are null, and correctly returns true for identical blocks.\n",
